e university, he appeared in stage productions of \\\"King Lear\\\", \\\"Six Degrees of Separation\\\" and \\\"Ain't Misbehavin'\\\". In 2009, Hill was nominated for the Joseph Jefferson\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0230-94842671373a:d04\", \"text\": \"Young Graham is remarkably composed and naturalistic as Percy and the underrated Leguizamo makes the most of his best role in ages . The music is fabulously funky , creating the up-tempo mood that permeates the second half of the film . There really is a lot to like here , which makes it easy enough to overlook those aspects that go unexplained . For example , Inez lives in a luxurious house with an armada of domestic staff and is always making reference to her work , yet we never get any sense of what this work entails and\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [], \"prior_explanation\": \"I am uncertain about Jon Hill's specific profession as this name is common and lacks unique context in my training data to identify a specific individual.\"}"
